[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0010","text":"辛苦了，灯织"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0020","text":"今天也很棒哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0030","text":"非常感谢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0040","text":"那件衣服，也稍微习惯一些了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0050","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0060","text":"是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0070","text":"一想到要尽全力发挥，\n就会忘记那件事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0080","text":"因为偶像是要连衣服一起算在内的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0090","text":"连衣服一起算在内的偶像，确实是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0100","text":"是的\n所以，真的已经没问题了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20200200_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
